{"id":"628287","name":"凉拌虾仁蚕豆","author":"Hhxj","authorId":"12848515","desc":"","cover":"images/628287/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"蚕豆","amount":"500g（连壳）"},{"name":"海虾","amount":"10只"}],"sub":[{"name":"干红辣椒","amount":"2个"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"少许"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材如上图。","img":"images/628287/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蚕豆去壳。","img":"images/628287/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"再剥掉外皮。","img":"images/628287/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅里放开水，加入2小勺盐，把蚕豆放进去焯水2分钟左右。","img":"images/628287/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捞出沥干水分备用。","img":"images/628287/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把挑去虾线的虾仁放入开水里焯至变色。","img":"images/628287/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"捞出来和蚕豆放一起。","img":"images/628287/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"小碗里放入1小勺白糖，加入禾然有机糙米醋1小勺。","img":"images/628287/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再加入1大勺六月鲜特级原汁酱油。","img":"images/628287/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入适量开水拌匀。","img":"images/628287/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"热锅放油烧热，加入蒜泥炒香。","img":"images/628287/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入干红辣椒圈炒香。","img":"images/628287/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入调料汁烧开。","img":"images/628287/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"淋在虾仁蚕豆上拌匀。","img":"images/628287/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"盛盘喽。","img":"images/628287/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"撒上白芝麻。","img":"images/628287/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"来一勺吧！","img":"images/628287/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/628287/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"现在蚕豆刚上市，很新鲜，焯水不易过长，太软就碎了。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}